      "solution": "a, o, b, c = input().split()\n\na = int(a)\nb = int(b)\n\nif o == \"?\":\n    c = int(c)\n\n    if a + b == c:\n        print(\"+\")\n    elif a - b == c:\n        print(\"-\")\n    elif a * b == c:\n        print(\"*\")\n    else:\n        print(\"/\")\nelse:\n    if o == \"+\":\n        print(a + b)\n    elif o == \"-\":\n        print(a - b)\n    elif o == \"*\":\n        print(a * b)\n    else:\n        print(a // b)",
